{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In a vision.</b> In the visions of prophecy." "And the sense of \"I am a shield for you\": I was a shield for you and delivered you from the hand of the kings. I will also give you reward, for your spirit volunteered to rescue your brother's son with few men, and you relied on me."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:37.255329958Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}